The timeout you’re seeing is due to the size of the month‑end stock valuation export (over 100,000 rows). Please run the report using the **“Execute in background”** option. The report will be processed in the background, and you can retrieve the exported Excel file from the spool list the next morning.

Let me know if you need any assistance locating the spool list or scheduling the background run."}

